# Files allowed to call a model API directly (telemetry sprint 3 call-site guard,
# tests/unit/test_llm_call_sites.py). Every other LLM call goes through libs/models'
# chat provider, whose attempts telemetry records (telemetry.llm).
# <path> | <reason>
libs/models/src/models/openai_compat.py | the instrumented provider itself: emits one AttemptRecord per HTTP attempt
services/generation-service/src/generation_service/adapters/inference.py | Layer C inline completion (24 tokens, 600 ms budget); not tied to a recording, no per-run record (Sprint 0 Q8)
